# verbs.pdl - the deskopoly manifest: the known mechanics as data (pass 1, 2026-11-07; BOOK 08-roadmap/design-docs/HANDOFF-NOV-7 section 10, D48 BRAIN rows, D49 one door).
#   GAME / VERB rows keep the shape verbgen reads (events-hq ops/verbgen.c parses ONLY these two row types; I read its source, I did not run it on this file).
#   FLOW  | verb | reads | writes          which hard-state files a verb touches (read by `deskopoly mechanics`, so a viewer can draw the data flow without reading C)
#   BRAIN | dec_key | verb | phases | ok_outcomes | bad_outcomes | note     which verbs a pet may CHOOSE and which harness CASE names judge them (checked by brain_lint)
#   page: no for all of these in pass 1 (no event pages generated yet; S3 of the plan fires them through pages).
GAME | deskopoly | deskopoly_verb | ops/+x/deskopoly.+x | ops/deskopoly.c
VERB | new       | no | ui | seed players | start a game: writes the first ledger row (the seed is hard state)
VERB | roll      | no | ui | -            | the current player rolls two dice (seeded, recorded), moves, and the landing resolves (Start bonus, levy, rent, or a tile for sale)
VERB | buy       | no | ui | -            | buy the tile the current player stands on (refused when unaffordable or not for sale)
VERB | skip      | no | ui | -            | decline the tile for sale
VERB | end_turn  | no | ui | -            | finish the turn; the next active player is up
VERB | autoplay  | no | ui | -            | play the whole game with each player's style (pets stand-in); writes decision rows
VERB | status    | no | ui | -            | read-only: the whole state, derived by replaying the ledger
VERB | replay    | no | ui | -            | read-only: replay the ledger and print its state hash (refuses a ledger that does not reproduce itself)
VERB | check     | no | ui | -            | read-only: replay plus invariants (money conservation, ownership, positions)
VERB | mechanics | no | ui | -            | read-only: the known mechanics and hard state as plain rows (a projection of these files, for an editor)
VERB | seat      | no | ui | player human\|pet | change who drives a seat (a ledger row, legal out of turn: a control change, not a game move)
VERB | audit     | no | ui | -            | read-only no-ghost-data check: state/ holds only the files state.pdl declares (LEDGER, PROJECTION, CONFIG, PREFERENCE); a projection must name a real regenerating verb
VERB | tick      | no | ui | -            | ONE step for the current seat: a pet seat performs its next verb, a human seat makes tick wait
VERB | ui        | no | ui | -            | write state/ui.txt: the window feed, a projection of the replayed ledger (show_* keys are 1 or EMPTY)
VERB | ledger_hash | no | ui | skip_verb  | read-only digest of the ledger rows, optionally without one verb (for example seat), so two games can be compared exactly
VERB | page      | no | ui | desk_dir atlas | draw the board as an editor desk page (cells.txt, map.txt, ...) from board.pdl + page.pdl + the replayed ledger; owned tiles show their owner
VERB | preview   | no | ui | desk_dir out.raw | a FLAT top-down picture of a desk (no depth, not the engine render), raw RGBA for raw_to_png
FLOW | new       | rules.pdl,board.pdl        | state/ledger.txt
FLOW | roll      | state/ledger.txt,board.pdl | state/ledger.txt
FLOW | buy       | state/ledger.txt,board.pdl | state/ledger.txt
FLOW | skip      | state/ledger.txt           | state/ledger.txt
FLOW | end_turn  | state/ledger.txt           | state/ledger.txt
FLOW | autoplay  | state/ledger.txt,rules.pdl | state/ledger.txt,state/decisions.txt
FLOW | status    | state/ledger.txt           | -
FLOW | replay    | state/ledger.txt           | -
FLOW | check     | state/ledger.txt           | -
FLOW | mechanics | verbs.pdl,rules.pdl,board.pdl,state/ledger.txt | state/mechanics.txt
FLOW | seat      | state/ledger.txt           | state/ledger.txt
FLOW | audit     | state.pdl,verbs.pdl,state/ | -
FLOW | tick      | state/ledger.txt,rules.pdl | state/ledger.txt,state/decisions.txt
FLOW | ui        | state/ledger.txt           | state/ui.txt
FLOW | ledger_hash | state/ledger.txt        | -
FLOW | page      | board.pdl,page.pdl,state/ledger.txt | <desk_dir>/cells.txt,map.txt,events.txt,skin.txt,extrusion.pdl,cells.rgba
FLOW | preview   | <desk_dir>/cells.txt,cells.rgba | <out.raw>
BRAIN | roll     | roll     | rules,autoplay,refusals | ok  |                 | every turn starts with a roll; nothing to choose
BRAIN | buy      | buy      | autoplay,refusals       | ok  | blocked,refused | choose to buy the tile under you; blocked when the cash is not there
BRAIN | skip     | skip     | autoplay                | ok  |                 | choose to leave the tile for the bank
BRAIN | end_turn | end_turn | autoplay                | ok  |                 | hand the dice on
